\nfor participating, you also get to\\fkeep the Bug-type Pokémon you catch.","msg_0389_R35R0201_00002":"Sorry to tell you this, but the\\nPokéathlon Dome is still under\\fconstruction, and the entrance there\\fis off-limits.\\rYou know what a rush construction is?\\rIn short, they are working really hard.\\nIt shouldn’t take too long.\\rJust a little more patience, OK?","msg_0389_R35R0201_00003":"The Pokéathlon Dome is this way.\\rPlease go through the entrance gate,\\nand do participate in the games!","msg_0389_R35R0201_00004":"Arrgh!\\rWhen is the Pokéathlon going to\\nbe ready?\\rI can’t just sit here and wait!\\nI’ll go on an around-Johto run!","msg_0389_R35R0201_00005":"I’ve been waiting for this moment!\\rBehold my friendship with my Pokémon!","msg_0389_R35R0201_00006":"I wonder if I can participate, too.\\nIt’s only running with Pokémon, right?","msg_0389_R35R0201_00007":"Play collectively with your Pokémon,\\ntrust your Pokémon, and believe in your\\fPokémon’s potential!\\rYour friendship with Pokémon\\nwill make your dream come true!\\rPokéathlon for you!","msg_0389_R35R0201_00008":"Charge your energy with friendship!\\nGive Aprijuice to your Pokémon!","msg_0389_R35R0201_00009":"Tap tap ding ding!\\rWe are in a big hurry!\\nJust a little more work before you\\fcan come through.\\rI hope you are looking forward to it!","msg_0389_R35R0201_00010":"Hey, hey!\\nWatch yourself! The construction\\fmakes it dangerous around here.\\rJust wait a little longer for the\\nexciting reveal!\\r"},"initTriggers":[{"var":"VAR_UNK_4118","value":1,"script":"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_010 + 1"}],"initScripts":{"OnResume":"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_009 + 1","OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_012 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_R35R0201_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_R35R